<title>USA: Continental Can knows of no reason for rise.</title>
<headline>Continental Can knows of no reason for rise.</headline>
<dateline>SYOSSET, N.Y. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Can Co Inc said on Tuesday it knows of no new developments since its October 29, 1996 earnings release that would account for the unusually active trading in its shares.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange had requested that the company make a statement indicating any developments that would explain the 1-1/2 point increase in the company's share price to 16-1/4, the company said.</p>
</text>
